ROOKE HUMSHEEER NE KAHA BHAIYA <br>
AYE GARIBUL WATAN RAZA BHAIYA<br>
<br>
1. WASWASE DIL MEIN MERE AATE HAI <br>
 KYUN SHAHER HAI YEH GHAMZADA BHAIYA<br>
<br>
2. KAMSINI MEIN TAQI PA VAVAILA <br>
 DOUR YATEEMA KA AA GAYA BHAIYA<br>
<br>
3. HAAYE KISNE ZAHER DIYA TUMKO <br>
 KYA WOH MUSLIM NA THA RAZA BHAIYA<br>
<br>
4. MEIN MADINE SE AAYI HOON MILNE <br>
 KIS TARAF HO MERE RAZA BHAIYA<br>
<br>
5. UTH GAYE TUM JAHAN SE GURBAT MEIN <br>
 AUR NA AAYEE MUJHE QAZA BHAIYA<br>
<br>
6. BIN TUMHARE MEIN JI NA PAOUNGI <br>
 KAB SE KARTI HOON ILTEJA BHAIYA<br>
<br>
7. MEIN BHI SHAMIL HOON GHAM MEIN SAATH TERE <br>
 AAEE ZEHRA KI YEH SADA BHAIYA<br>
